Fast-GATK GatherPileupSummaries AF formatting evidence (2026-08-31)

Source change:
- fastgatk-native/src/gather_pileup_summaries_tool.cpp now delegates AF serialization
  to the shared Java Double.toString-compatible formatter instead of fixed
  setprecision(15).
- fastgatk-core/include/fastgatk/io/java_numeric.hpp applies Java's
  fixed/scientific cut-over, exponent spelling, integral and negative-zero forms;
  Get/GatherPileupSummaries and CalculateContamination share this boundary.

Oracle and regression:
- GATK 4.6.2.0/native high-precision AF table oracle (OpenMP) -> pass, table_bytes_exact=true
- GATK 4.6.2.0/native high-precision AF table oracle (Serial) -> pass, table_bytes_exact=true
- fastgatk-gather-pileup-summaries-contract (OpenMP) -> 1/1 passed
- fastgatk-gather-pileup-summaries-contract (Serial) -> 1/1 passed
- GATK/native oracle includes 0.0/1.0e-4/1.0e-3 formatting cut-over cases -> byte-exact output
- Previous post-GetPileup-fix full CTest baseline: OpenMP 81/81, Serial 81/81.
